changes in their magnetic waves as well. Huh?

364
00:21:02,100 --> 00:21:05,740
In fact, some islands have
waves that disappear altogether.

365
00:21:06,460 --> 00:21:07,290
Huh?

366
00:21:07,373 --> 00:21:09,437
Then how are we supposed
to find out where they are?

367
00:21:09,520 --> 00:21:12,617
Well, you're sure to lose
your way with only one needle.

368
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:16,120
