371
00:21:23,700 --> 00:21:25,997
Each of the needles is
recording the magnetic

372
00:21:26,080 --> 00:21:29,177
waves from one of three
different islands. This way,

373
00:21:29,260 --> 00:21:31,637
you'll be able to assess
multiple paths and determine

374
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:35,177
