your instincts as a navigator.

375
00:21:35,260 --> 00:21:38,897
It's likely to make the difference
between life and death for you.

376
00:21:38,980 --> 00:21:42,297
A skilled navigator will know
which direction is safest by

377
00:21:42,380 --> 00:21:45,257
simply observing the slightest
movement of their needles.

378
00:21:45,340 --> 00:21:49,693
There are no guarantees, but there is
a good rule of thumb you can follow.

379
00:21:50,480 --> 00:21:53,400
Erratic movement means more danger.

380
00:21:54,220 --> 00:21:58,573
Changes in magnetic waves are often
