have to help you keep it.

475
00:27:18,140 --> 00:27:22,316
Remember, no matter what happens,
you must never break a promise, ever.

476
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:23,877
You know what, though?

477
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:24,960
Count me in.

478
00:27:26,500 --> 00:27:27,977
Oh, not me.

479
00:27:28,060 --> 00:27:30,017
And me, of course.

480
00:27:30,100 --> 00:27:31,137
Yeah, me too.

481
00:27:31,220 --> 00:27:32,597
And me.

482
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:33,697
Me too.

483
00:27:33,780 --> 00:27:35,180
