497
00:29:02,520 --> 00:29:04,497
The surface is full of
humans who hate our kind.

498
00:29:04,580 --> 00:29:06,297
There's no telling what they'll do if I.

499
00:29:06,380 --> 00:29:09,277
What I mean is.

500
00:29:09,360 --> 00:29:11,277
