humans aren't very nice.

501
00:29:11,360 --> 00:29:12,190
That's all.

502
00:29:12,380 --> 00:29:13,857
But they're not all the same.

503
00:29:13,940 --> 00:29:16,646
Some of them are heroes,
like Straw Hat Luffy.

504
00:29:20,820 --> 00:29:22,057
Hey, Boss Jinbei.

505
00:29:22,140 --> 00:29:23,080
Perfect timing!

506
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:26,480
